Halftone Dossier demo — 《胖橘案卷 Case File: Chubby》 (30.0 s)
Credits and licences for everything used in this folder.

PICTURE
- All artwork (cat, props, halftone dots, stamps, paper texture, grain, transitions) is drawn procedurally
  by code in index.html (SVG + Canvas 2D). No images, textures, photos or 3D assets are used.
- Rendering: Playwright (playwright-core 1.63.0, Apache-2.0) driving Chromium headless shell;
  encoding with FFmpeg (libx264, LGPL/GPL).

MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
- Original score and all SFX synthesized from scratch by music.py (NumPy + SciPy, BSD-3-Clause).
  No samples, loops or third-party recordings. Written for this film; free to reuse with the repo.

VOICE
- None. The film has no narration and no TTS; all storytelling is on-screen Chinese title cards.

